      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `consume_event.py` file that consumes one message from a managed subscription or queue, I need to choose a concrete external provider. For this task, I will use Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) as the external provider. The code will include the necessary imports and use the specific client class from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
